# Anything not strictly needed for `docker build`.

# Dot-entries at the context root: VCS metadata, local tool state, editor
# config, env files. None of it belongs in an image, and ignoring them as a
# group means no tool name has to be listed here.
.*

# Docs, scripts and evidence are not needed inside the image
*.md
!README.md
docs/
screenshots/
scripts/

# Test and coverage output
coverage.*
*.test
*.out
